{
  "bodyHash": "7e8f1c3675c21872",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4b27a9e4-8414-4d22-bb39-268eebd99129.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1082\" height=\"137\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:793px;display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QW3HqoWXRFg?t=21s\" width=\"793\" height=\"464\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_8f44d6cd-1169-4d2d-9511-b5ef389b18a4.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></strong></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Arda 的幽匿模組是一款透過強化遊戲中的幽匿方塊，讓你製作更強大工具與物品的模組。</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>1.4 及以上版本需要&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>GECKOLIB</strong></a><strong>。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 模組 -</strong></h1>\n\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_55965104-f602-4470-a603-b3ecb63ccd4a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_6de15eb4-13de-4a66-b669-df765ce41cae.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>新傳送門</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">遊戲中新增了一座傳送門，你可以利用從古城收集的新材料製作傳送門點燃器，來啟動這座古老的傳送門。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>古代世界：</strong>要進入此維度，必須使用<strong>古代世界傳送門點燃器</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4d9c1c2c-050b-479c-8b5c-baa0426a7232.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿花卉</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">新增了多種花卉與植物，可用於遊戲中的裝飾與照明。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9e8b95fa-bb7f-4139-918b-726e60d17cd4.png\"></strong></h3>\n<div>\n<h1><strong>古城礦物</strong></h1>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_c5246a13-0b0d-46b1-a25f-08b2877a5b7b.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_34a701e5-29aa-47a2-a43e-fead4b9d5218.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>新戰利品</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">遊戲中新增了更多物品，包括可在古城寶箱中找到的幽匿升級模板。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e7154663-0921-4958-a706-e42c4dff2ccb.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_bc0c0567-3cdc-4ecb-ab65-228f525df182.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_23463e01-80c6-43fb-8951-85de0964145d.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿傀儡</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">在新首領區域中，你可以挑戰幽匿傀儡首領，並利用它掉落的幽匿水晶製作全新的幽匿多用途工具！</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ff537b25-edec-407c-84ba-5e9a7ca026ce.png\"></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fc741a09-dd2d-48cf-96fd-edab0890f7f5.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>暗影獵手</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_44fc05ba-dd0b-410a-a13d-87fcf89a4d33.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_f00db0a4-80df-4f05-94d5-db9dcfbc0da5.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_93d053d1-63d9-410a-97bb-71701e28ded5.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_959ff98e-4c38-4cc1-8e59-364dba172f2b.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>輻射監守者</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b40fdda4-6413-4979-bc77-18f3cf9a7cd6.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76fd5e0f-bfda-4bf5-a466-3630603d5623.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿之臂</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">新加入的幽匿之臂能讓你擁有與監守者同樣強大的拳擊能力。這些幽匿之臂可使用在古城寶箱與生物身上獲得的材料來製作。</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1f44b473-cc9d-4197-b6ee-7f21bfeb369f.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b2a99088-58fa-4896-936a-eb1539792919.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1fc8c2bd-6f35-4e5f-b726-b38c1e41c56e.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿金物品！</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">比下界合金更強大的全新幽匿金工具。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9fd7e796-35b1-42bc-ac15-1b37312ec27a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2c7d7561-842a-4854-9a5b-2a25e18da36e.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>靈魂幽匿平原</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">此處的地面草皮會使生物移動變慢，相較於普通幽匿草；周圍的靈魂感測器更會進一步減緩玩家的速度。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_ec846fa0-ce1b-47e0-a044-940c96926477.png\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿平原</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這是新維度中的平坦地形。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e6020889-c83c-4c99-bcde-eef4c0c761c1.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>黑樺木森林</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這是一個危險的生物群系，密集的樹林中棲息著發出吱吱聲的生物。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_605904f1-61a8-4013-95c9-413b4960fce9.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿沙漠</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這裡是缺乏木材資源的乾旱地區。四周設有古老的傳送門，可供我們返回常規世界。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e3c8c116-1afb-45fe-b727-99c12dad42c1.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>紫藤森林</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這是一個被岩石環繞的生物群系，這裡的樹木比其他群系更加美麗多彩。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_b7df097e-32a4-454f-96fe-4c1686b9676d.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿森林</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">幽匿林地是幽匿平原生物群系的另一個版本，擁有更多的樹木與較少的骨骸。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_414f0aa3-7617-4e67-952c-ad94e85f4990.png\"></h1>\n<h1><strong>輻射輕木森林</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_eda60703-423f-477f-b5dc-00d32d854590.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fa8da897-79e7-499b-bfa8-5ef103658cc1.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿木材組</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"1205\" height=\"75\"></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1ac01893-6955-4624-b41f-fb1e1354280a.png\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>黑樺木材組</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_e8e70767-1c3b-45f4-b2ee-6eceaf3b058a.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>&nbsp;紫藤木材組</strong></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_a584f0bc-5591-42ea-898b-6099ace7d22b.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>輻射輕木材組</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_1b69d7f7-8530-43b5-a645-10349e1fce22.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_50598260-632b-4ae5-b744-689af583bb30.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_efe7618d-1b7b-45b4-90a9-f377145dd764.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿爬行者</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>幽匿主題的爬行者，爆炸時會在周圍產生黑暗與減速效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2d7b4e9e-d077-4951-8122-2e57a0b53897.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_4bfd2f4a-7b44-4423-874b-79d316c9b74f.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿骷髏</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>幽匿主題的骷髏，擊中生物時會將其擊退並施加黑暗效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_bc5c4e19-a4d5-4d56-a7d8-72de778c8d07.png\"></strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿終界使者</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>幽匿主題的終界使者。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_dba77b96-6ee1-4f4b-a94b-fb73ec921c83.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿魚</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\">目前沒有特別動作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_d501e0ce-da66-45fa-a1cf-61a2cba3fb59.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿狐狸</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>幽匿主題的狐狸。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_9e356707-e327-4467-9bbf-da7fbe61cbdb.png\"></p>\n<h1><strong>敏捷史萊姆</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>這是一種速度極快且靈活的史萊姆；死亡時會像普通史萊姆一樣分裂成兩隻。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2ee022be-d3a9-4510-9982-d8499e0945c7.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿幽靈</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>幽匿幽靈是一種飛行的敵對生物，會試圖攻擊玩家。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_75909905-e438-492a-bf07-478b8dee2792.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿嘎吱怪</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>一種擁有強大手臂的敵對嘎吱怪。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_76ec9cb8-0c86-459f-b3ee-9be94c69d8d2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_2614dde6-c021-4fad-98ba-13f9edc2c3a3.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_6682982c-2205-4703-b1e5-4c3f33205bfe.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>幽匿村民</strong></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>一位村莊商人，專門販售古城與深暗之域生物群系專屬的物品。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_c0a368e9-e92c-4bac-aebe-1a14d7c583e2.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_f1a8bcc5-63a3-418d-ac35-5b609c62cdbd.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"106\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_cee91609-8965-4784-9005-b7baa64607de.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>進階熔爐</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">將熔鐵桶與熔岩幽匿桶放入前兩個槽位，接著將要轉化的物品放入第3個槽位，並在下方添加燃料，最後從最後兩個槽位取出常規版本的兩桶液體與轉化後的物品。操作範例請見上方圖片。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_12e85be5-7ac2-44c6-ab2b-355ae19a3d8a.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_02b588a7-b8bc-4e4c-9239-0561f47fcfa4.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>進階熔爐</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">這就是進階熔爐的外觀！</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_44046397-a602-4049-ac64-1d79431f2108.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_7d390d6c-8416-473f-a09f-8bde137412ba.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>新材質</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">遊戲中新增了進階熔爐，協助你將下界合金物品提升至更高階段，並在遇到困難時提供便利。</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_6bdf82b0-def1-49c4-ab2a-e7d17d1c1d43.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 版本 -</strong></h1>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-1.21.1</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-1.20.1</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-此版本是將 Arda's Sculks 1.4.3.3 從 1.21.1 降級至 1.20.1。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-結構中將不會出現箱子戰利品，且可能存在許多錯誤。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-這些錯誤將不會進行修復，開發重心將放在新版本上。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 已知問題 -</strong></h1>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>(如果我的模組在 Minecraft 伺服器上發生崩潰，請確保已安裝 Geckolib，因為若未安裝，模組將會直接崩潰而非顯示警告！)<br><br>- 除了一些材質錯誤外，我並未發現任何會影響遊戲玩法的錯誤。<br><br>- 若您使用的是 1.20.1 版本，可能會遇到許多錯誤，因為該版本是透過降級 1.21.1 版本而來，我已盡力修復了這些問題。</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>- 翻譯 -</strong></h1>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_fe5a94ce-ebdd-42b1-a135-92ba73b9d529.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"> &nbsp;<strong>Arda Ayd. (Ixra) :&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fixraplayer.github.io%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ixraplayer.github.io/</a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_a2dea3a6-e9b8-4156-893d-ab1be0a5e019.png\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\"><strong>&nbsp; Iago Emanuel</strong> :&nbsp; <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://iagoemanuel.weebly.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://iagoemanuel.weebly.com/</a></h1>\n</div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/953793/description_979ca642-f91c-4541-8c86-4588214cd64c.png\" width=\"850\" height=\"53\"></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">您可以在整合包中使用我的模組。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">關於此模組的更多詳細資訊：<a href=\"https://github.com/IxraPlayer/Ardas-Sculks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/IxraPlayer/Ardas-Sculks</a></p>",
